{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>They did not miscarry.</b> They did not cast their young — as in ״רֶחֶם מַשְׁכִּיל״ (Hosea 9), ״תְּפַלֵּט פָּרָתוֹ וְלֹא תְשַׁכֵּל״ (Job 21)." "<b>And your rams.</b> From here the Sages said: a ram one day old is called אַיִל — for if not, what is its praise? 'I did not eat rams' — but he ate lambs? If so, he is a robber (Bava Kamma 65)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:33.829438387Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}